{
  "name": "Deploy AWS VPN",
  "type": "automation",
  "description": "Deploys the AWS side of the lab's site-to-site VPN: Terraform plans it on the Gateway, a Work Center approval shows the plan, exactly that plan is applied, and the pre-shared key goes to Vault and Secrets Manager (PID S13, ADR 0068)",
